<title>UK: Export Finance &amp; Insurance sets A$101 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Export Finance &amp; Insurance sets A$101 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sanwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EXPORT FINANCE &amp; INSURANCE CO</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  COMMONWEALTH OF AUSTRALIA</p>
<p> AMT    A$101 MLN     COUPON     7.125     MATURITY    05.DEC.11</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.175   PAY DATE  S-05.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.10	REOFFER    =</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON TO 15.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
